  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/659/659-99.htm",
  "statuteText": "659:99 Forwarding Ballots to the Secretary of State. –\n\nIf any person shall make a request for a recount as provided in RSA 660, or if the secretary of state shall request the ballots of the recent election, the clerk having the custody of such ballots shall, at the request of the secretary of state, forward the ballots forthwith to the secretary of state."
